# Coursistant LMS Frontend (Subfolder Rules)

- **Planned organization home:** `https://github.com/Coursistant-Inc/lms-frontend`
- **Current authorized working repository:** `https://github.com/picapicaowo-alt/coursistant-lisa`
- **App root:** `lms/`
- **Standards doc:** `lms/PROJECT_STANDARDS.md` — read before editing frontend code.

## 1. Stack & Development Rules
- **Language:** React 18 + TypeScript (`.ts` / `.tsx`) for all **new** code.
- **Server State:** TanStack Query (`@tanstack/react-query`) + API services in `src/apis/services/*`.
- **Client State:** Zustand only for complex page/workspace UI state.
- **Styles:** SCSS modules with design tokens (`src/styles/_tokens.scss`).
- **Tests:** Colocate `*.test.ts(x)` with unit under test using Vitest + Testing Library.
- **Verification:** Run `npm run typecheck` and `npm run lint` in `lms/` before committing.
- **自测要求**：每次有任何改动，你都要先自测（类型检查、单元测试等），自测完全没问题之后，再告诉用户。

## 2. Strict Prohibitions
- Do NOT add new `.jsx` / `.js` source files.
- Keep the configured authorized origin until the organization migration is
  explicitly approved; do not point remotes at `bink44/lms-frontend` or
  unrelated forks.
- Keep SCSS Modules and existing design tokens as the default. MUI or another
  UI kit requires an explicit frontend architecture decision and a shared UI
  integration boundary; do not add ad-hoc kit imports in feature pages.
- Do NOT commit QA screenshots (`local-*.png`, `dev-8084-*.png`) unless asked.
- Do NOT rewrite legacy chat/profile JSX unless explicitly scoped for migration.

## 3. Legacy Quarantine
Quarantined files — do not "fix" for style only; migrate in dedicated tasks:
- `src/components/ChatContent.tsx`
- `src/pages/DetailWorkspacePage/**` (v1 assignment shell)
- `src/**/*.jsx` under chat, profile, settings, old roster
- Legacy files with `// @ts-nocheck` are quarantined — do not expand them.

## 4. Security & PR Checklist
- [ ] No secrets, credentials, or tokens in git.
- [ ] New UI is `.tsx` with typed props.
- [ ] API calls routed through `apis/services` + typed `apis/types`.
- [ ] Loading, error, and empty states properly handled.
- [ ] Unit tests added/updated and passing.
